sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Du khach
    participant FE as Frontend SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OrderSvc as Order Service
    participant AuthSvc as Auth Service
    participant ContentSvc as Content Service
    participant VnPay as Cong VNPAY Sandbox

    User->>FE: Chon Nang cap Premium hoac Mua qua luu niem
    FE->>GW: POST /api/orders/premium (Authorization: Bearer token)
    GW->>GW: UserAuthGlobalFilter xac thuc JWT, gan X-User-Id, X-Internal-Api-Key
    GW->>OrderSvc: Forward POST /api/orders/premium
    opt Don hang qua luu niem
        OrderSvc->>ContentSvc: POST /api/content/internal/products/prices
        ContentSvc-->>OrderSvc: Danh sach gia hop le
    end
    OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Khoi tao Order (PENDING_PAYMENT, han 15 phut)
    OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Tao URL thanh toan kem chu ky HMAC-SHA512
    OrderSvc-->>GW: Tra ve { orderCode, paymentUrl, expiresAt }
    GW-->>FE: Tra ve { paymentUrl }
    FE->>User: Chuyen huong sang cong VNPAY
    User->>VnPay: Nhap thong tin the ATM Sandbox & Xac nhan OTP
    VnPay-->>GW: GET /api/orders/vnpay/return (vnp_ResponseCode=00)
    GW->>OrderSvc: Forward GET /api/orders/vnpay/return
    OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Xac thuc chu ky bam, cap nhat don hang sang PAID
    opt Don hang Premium
        OrderSvc->>AuthSvc: POST /api/auth/internal/entitlements/{userId}/premium
        AuthSvc->>AuthSvc: Cap nhat user plan=PREMIUM (365 ngay)
        AuthSvc-->>OrderSvc: 200 OK
    end
    OrderSvc-->>FE: Redirect 302 ve /thanh-toan/ket-qua?orderCode=SV-xxx&status=success
    FE->>User: Thong bao thanh cong & Mo khoa thuyet minh ngoai ngu
